# Terra, Magical Adept (CR 714.2b, 714.4, 712.14a, 701.13, 107.4): Bot1 mills Phyrexian Arena into hand and casts it, then turn 3 Trance returns
# Terra as Esper Terra. Each chapter targets the nonlegendary enchantment Arena (Esper Terra is legendary): a token copy that is not a Saga
# asks for no lore counters, and is sacrificed at the beginning of Bot1's next end step. At turn 9 chapter IV adds {W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}
# and exiles Esper Terra, who returns front face up as Terra, Magical Adept, a new object that mills five cards again.

